== Walkthrough ==

{{expand}}

'''NOTE: the Trooper was possibly removed from the game'''

[[Trooper Neozite]], inside the Warsliks Woods entrance in West Cabilis states how much he wants a drink of [[Legion Lager]] which the master brewer can no longer make.  This can be brewed (see brewing recipes).

You get some experience and small coin with the following faction hits:

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Legion of Cabilis]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Cabilis Residents]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Scaled Mystics]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Crusaders Of Greenmist]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Swift Tails]] got better.
</div>

